# herdr-prs repo list — EXAMPLE. Copy to repos.conf, or just press ctrl-e in the
# dashboard to generate your own with the picker (recommended).
#
# One repo per line: owner/repo, then an optional TAB and the local clone path.
# A line with no path is resolved by scanning ROOTS (see config.sh) for a clone
# whose origin remote ends in owner/repo(.git).

# With an explicit local clone path:
vippsas/ongoing-due-diligence	/Users/you/Development/Rider/ongoing-due-diligence

# Without a path — resolved automatically from ROOTS:
vippsas/pling-backend
